{
  "id": "git-protect/package-wiring",
  "skill": "git-protect",
  "feature": "The ninth command is wired into the sync script, the Hermes index, the adapters, the Gemini command, the install guide and the three READMEs",
  "invocations": {
    "installer": "python -X utf8 scripts/sync_hosts.py",
    "claude": "/magos:GitProtect",
    "codex": "$magos:git-protect",
    "hermes": "/magos:git-protect",
    "gemini": "/GitProtect"
  },
  "test_object": {
    "files": [
      "scripts/sync_hosts.py",
      "scripts/validate_gemini_adapter.py",
      "__init__.py",
      "commands/GitProtect.md",
      "commands/GitProtect.toml",
      "skills/git-protect/SKILL.md",
      "skills/git-protect/agents/openai.yaml",
      "SKILL.md",
      "references/commands.md",
      "references/installation.md",
      "README.md",
      "README.en.md",
      "README.ja.md"
    ]
  },
  "expected": [
    "COMMAND_NAMES ends with GitSweep, GitPlan, GitProtect, so sync_hosts.py installs commands/GitProtect.md for Claude, and the Codex and Hermes packages carry skills/git-protect with its openai.yaml.",
    "The Hermes plugin index describes git-protect as a command that sets or lifts a branch protection and must never be loaded by the model.",
    "The Gemini adapter lists GitProtect and its TOML command activates git-orchestrator.",
    "Docs list /GitProtect, /git-protect and $git-protect and say nine commands."
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "file": "scripts/sync_hosts.py",
      "contains": [
        "\"GitSweep\", \"GitPlan\", \"GitProtect\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "scripts/validate_gemini_adapter.py",
      "contains": [
        "\"GitSweep\", \"GitPlan\", \"GitProtect\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "__init__.py",
      "contains": [
        "\"git-protect\": \"Sets or lifts the protection of a branch against agents' commits and merges: run only when the user types /magos:git-protect. Never load it yourself.\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "commands/GitProtect.md",
      "contains": [
        "For a normal invocation, run the Multi-Agent Git Orchestrator command `/GitProtect $ARGUMENTS`.",
        "`references/commands.md` section **9. GitProtect**",
        "`magos` (plugin clone directory)",
        "`multi-agent-git-orchestrator` (frontmatter name)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "commands/GitProtect.toml",
      "contains": [
        "{{args}}",
        "activate_skill",
        "references/commands.md",
        "GitProtect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "skills/git-protect/SKILL.md",
      "contains": [
        "name: git-protect",
        "Use it only when the user explicitly invokes `/git-protect` in Hermes or `$git-protect` in Codex.",
        "2. `../../references/commands.md` section **9. GitProtect**",
        "Do not use `commands/*.md` for this adapter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "skills/git-protect/agents/openai.yaml",
      "contains": [
        "display_name: \"git-protect\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "references/installation.md",
      "contains": [
        "`/magos:GitRecon` … `/magos:GitProtect`",
        "共 9 个",
        "九个 `agents/openai.yaml`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "README.md",
      "contains": [
        "## 九个核心命令",
        "### `/GitProtect`",
        "└── GitProtect.md",
        "| GitProtect | `/GitProtect` | `/git-protect` | `$git-protect` |",
        "| Branch Protection |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "README.en.md",
      "contains": [
        "## The nine commands",
        "### `/GitProtect` — keep agents off a branch",
        "| GitProtect | `/GitProtect` | `/git-protect` | `$git-protect` |",
        "| Branch Protection |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "README.ja.md",
      "contains": [
        "## 9 つのコアコマンド",
        "### `/GitProtect`",
        "└── GitProtect.md",
        "| GitProtect | `/GitProtect` | `/git-protect` | `$git-protect` |",
        "| Branch Protection |"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
